LICENSE PENDING
===============

The license for flamingo-stitcher has not yet been finalized.

A license analysis is required before public release (see the project plan,
Phase 5). The goal is the most permissive license possible, but a key
constraint must be resolved first:

  - The GUI currently depends on PyQt5, which is GPLv3-or-commercial.
    Bundling PyQt5 in a distributed frozen executable would force the whole
    distribution to GPLv3 unless the GUI is migrated to PySide6/PySide2 (LGPL)
    or a commercial Qt/PyQt license is obtained.

Until this file is replaced with a real license, treat the code as
"all rights reserved" by the author(s).

Third-party component attributions will be collected in the NOTICE file.
